ay of thinking.'), ('førsteplads', 'word', '6cf2c773-27bc-5484-9380-311834312ac0', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'first place', 'Hun vandt en flot førsteplads.', 'She won a great first place.'), ('uvis', 'word', 'c2a1137a-e779-5cfe-b4d7-c91624a8aa21', 1, 'adjective', null, 'uncertain, unknown', 'Fremtiden er stadig uvis.', 'The future is still uncertain.'), ('klinisk', 'word', 'f0ae2d01-bb1f-527c-8f8e-273cfc1e0a68', 1, 'adjective', null, 'clinical', 'Lægemidlet er testet i et klinisk forsøg.', 'The drug has been tested in a clinical trial.'), ('magisk', 'word', 'e9e4c592-5567-5e81-be46-6d73fa2c7af9', 1, 'adjective', null, 'magical', 'Aftenen føltes helt magisk.', 'The evening felt completely magical.'), ('entré', 'word', '3692e5e5-4e5a-5003-b60e-e21746495d6c', 1, 'noun', 'en', 'hallway, entrance hall', 'Sæt skoene i entréen.', 'Put your shoes in the entrance hall.'), ('entré', 'word', '91e320b2-3910-50ae-ad43-f02b22a6e62b', 2, 'noun', 'en', 'admission fee, entrance fee', 'Der er gratis entré til museet i dag.', 'Admission to the museum is free today.'), ('knække', 'word', '11b3a24f-ee2c-513b-bea3-cb89f4db03ed', 1, 'verb', null, 'to snap, to break', 'Grenen knækkede under vægten.', 'The branch snapped under the weight.'), ('privatliv', 'word', '5b3a1505-fc86-5437-8958-009cbb7977cd', 1, 'noun', 'et', 'privacy, private life', 'Hun værner om sit privatliv.', 'She guards her privacy.'), ('endog', 'word', '9458b496-ce72-5886-b861-aea6aa14d8a3', 1, 'adverb', null, 'even', 'Han var endog villig til at hjælpe fjenden.', 'He was even willing to help the enemy.'), ('heftig', 'word', 'daabf1fd-7f0c-56cc-a1c0-266b453cfad2', 1, 'adjective', null, 'fierce, heated', 'Der var en heftig debat om emnet.', 'There was a heated debate on the topic.'), ('behagelig', 'word', '9423410b-47fb-50d4-b3aa-bdc0c67b81b9', 1, 'adjective', null, 'comfortable, pleasant', 'Sengen er meget behagelig at ligge i.', 'The bed is very comfortable to lie in.'), ('bid', 'word', '6203e948-ef87-5011-b1b9-5a54d88e91c7', 1, '